{"kind":"compaction","id":"p1-af06a9e1","receipt":{"trigger":"cache_expiry","thresholdTokens":320000,"summary":"## Objective
- Original task: improve the AGC admin accommodation and registration dashboards in this Next.js + Convex project (repo `home-coming`, branch `master`, Windows checkout at `C:\Users\USER\Documents\GitHub\home-coming`). That work is COMPLETE and verified (tsc 0, eslint 0, 116/116 vitest, convex dev --once ready, next build OK).
- NEW request (not started): 
  1. In admin accommodation Pools, allow admin to **add extra rooms/capacity** to each accommodation (type/scope pool top-ups, not physical rooms — the physical Rooms tab already exists).
  2. New settings feature: admin can assign **hubs allowed "payment on arrival" (POA)**. Assigned hubs' reps can register and book accommodation **without paying**; an **IOU receipt is auto-generated** at registration/booking that the rep can upload evidence against directly from the portal. Room/guests get assigned/allocated but totals are **NOT credited** as paid.
  3. Admin and finance see a **separate POA status table** covering both registrations and bookings.
  4. Later, admin can change POA status to **confirmed** when payment is made; rep status updates and the **IOU receipt becomes a paid receipt**.
  5. **IOU receipts must NOT be stored in the DB until confirmed** (generate on demand / transient until confirmation).
  6. Only hubs assigned the feature can use it (enforce server-side).
  7. **After implementing: test the additions, then `git commit` and `git push` to GitHub** ( [… 9,330 characters omitted] nce`, tsc/lint/vitest/build, and finally `git add` only the touched files and commit+push per user's explicit request.

## Relevant Files
- `convex/schema.ts`, `convex/schemaTypes.ts` — add POA fields/tables here; unions live in schemaTypes.
- `convex/agcAdminData.ts` — bulk review, trash, history, expiring holds, pools admin, reallocation, overview `getAgcOverview` (attention cards now link `/admin/registrations`, `/admin/accommodation`), `listAgcRegistrationsAdmin`/`listAgcBookingsAdmin` (guests now include phone/email). POA admin queries/mutations go here or a new module.
- `convex/agcRoomAssignments.ts` — rooms module; `listUnassignedGuestsAdmin` + `assertAssignable` gate on confirmed bookings (must accommodate POA).
- `convex/agcAccommodation.ts` — pool lazy-seeding (`loadPoolMutable`), `reserveUnits`/`releaseUnits`, `AGC_INVENTORY_SEED`; "add extra rooms to pools" = increase pool `total` (see existing `setPoolTotal` mutation + `getPoolTotalOverrides` in `convex/lib/agcSettingsRuntime.ts`); add a per-type/scope top-up mutation + PoolsTab UI.
- `convex/agcBookings.ts` — booking creation/pricing; POA booking path change here. Registration creation path similarly (find via `agcRegistrations` writers).
- `convex/agcAuth.ts` / `agcAuthData.ts` / `agcPortal.ts` — rep session + portal data; POA gating on rep side reads hub assignment here.
- `convex/lib/agcConfig.ts` — AGC_SETTING_KEYS, AGC_DEFAULTS, AGC_INVENTORY_SEED.
- `src/components/admin/agc/PoolsTab.tsx` — add "add capacity" UI next to reallocation form.
- `src/components/admin/agc/HubsRepsManager.tsx` + `src/app/admin/(console)/settings/page.tsx` (`AgcSettingsManager.tsx`) — hub POA assignment UI.
- `src/components/portal/RepRegistrationTab.tsx`, `RepAccommodationTab.tsx`, `PortalShell.tsx` — rep-side POA flow (skip payment, IOU view, evidence upload).
- `src/components/admin/agc/AgcAdminClient.tsx` / `BookingsTab.tsx` — add POA status table/section for admin+finance.
- `convex/lib/audit.ts` — `writeAuditLog` for POA actions.
- `convex/crons.ts` — crons (purge trash cron added; holds expiry every 5 min).
- `tests/agcBookingExport.test.ts` — pins export row shape; update when adding columns.
- `package.json` scripts: dev, build (runs gallery/tours manifest checks then next build), lint, test (vitest run).","preTokens":298756,"postTokens":30179,"durationMs":158486}}
