`tsc --noEmit` and eslint clean on all four files. [storageOrphans.test.ts](tests/storageOrphans.test.ts) is 5/5, including a new test proving the cron deletes only past-grace unreferenced blobs, keeps the referenced blob and a freshly uploaded one, writes exactly one audit entry as `system:storage-sweep`, and does nothing when everything is inside the grace window. Deployed to dev and ran the function live: `{batches: 1, deleted: 0, failed: 0, remaining: 0}`.

## About being charged twice

I can't see your Convex account, so I won't guess at a number, but the storage angle is ruled out: ~800 compressed receipts is roughly 150–250 MB, comfortably inside the 1 GB of file storage included even on Starter, and dev has no orphans to purge. Two ordinary explanations are worth checking on the invoice:

- **Professional is billed per developer seat** ($25/developer/month). A second invited teammate shows up as a second charge even if they never deploy.
- **Plan fee plus usage** appear as separate line items, and a mid-cycle upgrade adds a proration line — three charges in one month is normal there.

